Date: Mon, 20 Jan 2025 04:32:26 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] PixelOS: Add status bar lyric toggle to display settings

Adds a switch in Display -> Other display controls that toggles
Settings.Secure.STATUS_BAR_SHOW_LYRIC, consumed by the SystemUI
status bar lyric feature (ported from Evolution-X cnb).

Counterpart of Evolution-X Evolver commit 2d2e69a788b5 'Evolver: Add
status bar lyric [2/2]', adapted to stock AOSP Settings with the
standard PreferenceController pattern.

Change-Id: I5984d66b17e652a5a26350e1b4673a334820a862
---
 res/values/custom_strings.xml                 |  4 ++
 res/xml/display_settings.xml                  |  5 ++
 src/com/android/settings/DisplaySettings.java |  2 +
 .../StatusBarLyricPreferenceController.java   | 65 +++++++++++++++++++
 4 files changed, 76 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 src/com/android/settings/display/StatusBarLyricPreferenceController.java

